     1377   PROCEDURE no-benq-i-office.
     1378   DEFINE OUTPUT PARAMETER found as logical init no.
     1379   define buffer buf_sale-doc for ub.sale-doc.
     1380   CASE X-Radio-Task > 1:
     1381     WHEN YES then do:
